                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Colorado has led the country in protecting patients\u2019 credit scores from the burden of unexpected medical debt.\n\nThe Trump Administration\u2019s cruel attempts to upend these protections, as they leave countless working families without affordable coverage, will only worsen the health care crisis many Coloradans are facing.\n\nhttps://t.co/LzbKSJ99lk",
