                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Dave, a father to five in Littleton, is facing a $1,500/month increase to his family\u2019s health insurance plan.\n\nHe shared that their budget cannot handle this dramatic increase in coverage costs without radical changes to their family\u2019s daily life.\n\nNo Colorado family should be forced into this position because of Republicans\u2019 unwillingness to address this crisis.",
