                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today marks the longest government shutdown in American history, a shameful milestone for our country.\n\nAs Americans grapple with skyrocketing health insurance costs, federal workers continue to work without pay, and hungry families fear whether they will receive the food assistance they need, I am urging President Trump and Republicans to come to the table, protect the services our constituents rely on, and end this chaos.\n\nhttps://t.co/JTzLkjV8mW",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
