                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 50,
                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "America\u2019s veterans bravely answered the call to serve our country and sacrificed to defend our freedom.\n\nOn Veterans Day, we honor their service and remember our duty to ensure veterans in Colorado and across the country have the health care, housing, and support they\u2019ve earned and deserve.",
