                "quoted_status_profile_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 290,
                "retweet_count": 22,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Nearly 300,000 Coloradans face the real possibility of their monthly health care premiums doubling, tripling, or even quadrupling next year without the ACA tax credits Republicans have refused to extend.\n\nI won\u2019t stop fighting to restore those credits or to make health care affordable and accessible to working people in our state.",
