                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1562,
                "retweet_count": 50,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Coloradans are facing up to 400% or more in increased monthly premiums if we don\u2019t act now and extend ACA tax credits.\n\nThis will extend a critical lifeline to families, but it won\u2019t be enough.\n\nWe must fix our broken health care system and ensure every family has access to affordable care.",
