                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 33,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Rural Coloradans face enormous challenges to access quality health care.\n\nI\u2019m glad the Senate passed my bipartisan resolution establishing National Rural Health Day to shine a light on the barriers they face and our commitment to improve access to the care Coloradans need.",
