                "text": "\u201cOur family can\u2019t afford health care now.\u201d\n\n\u201cThis is a devastating increase.\u201d\n\n\u201cI\u2019m scared.\u201d\n\nColoradans continue to reach out to me, terrified they won\u2019t be able to afford their health insurance next year.\n\nThis is a matter of life and death for many, and allowing the ACA premium tax credits to expire will force them to make impossible choices.\n\nWe must extend this lifeline before it\u2019s too late.",
